      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesanoó lama mu alki/itaar. Ma aldinku'uumisaara' nee heé tlaákw, as tawa lamabu'usmoó lama tleehhit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boo/oó muu oo tlakweemaá tlehhtuú áw mu eeharaharaar, sleeme miti alkoomara' nee boo/aydá' lamabu'úngw lama gu duuxár áw baraá kwasleema as gan'amuú hee nguwa qwaareesiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narkutmo mu gurií ba/aar baraá kwasleemarose as adoodá' tawa narkutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bar slér wakusmoowók aga aán, laqaá daqwaywós aa qwaár, aqo un ki/ís dirósí ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bar daqoó wakusmoowók ugwa aán aa huú' nee huwaaro, kuúng ma tawó tlawaar, aqo un alee/ís huwaarós kawa gwet, as daqwaay iwa sihhiiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gan'amuú narkutmo mu qwaareesaar baraá kwasleemarose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng axweesanoó lama geewakaweek, múk dakuús wásl nee oo gan'amuú kooma mi tsu/aar, asma aníng tlakusmo u gan'amií harafaraaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng slukuma ma /ayaar, asma slukuma heé muruú tsatsahhaám gun iimi giwís, nee kwasleemár ganaa' ar hee gan hhitiín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hoomoó baraá tla/angwhúng hoót mu baramaanuusara', asma kuungá' adór hotaá dah'iima i dirii'iya' a xuá'. Asma kuungá' aáng sleeme dah'iima ana /agé' baraá yaamaá Misriro.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng baraá kureeraá lahhooe qamuuwók doosleek, dahaseek nee balaangók ku fíq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kurkú faanqwe qamuuwók in meér dooslaro, i dahaská sleeme. As kahhó' mukók kuduú narkuute nee makaá sla/a sleeme muruudá' baraadií dirií' nguwa /ayiya'. Adoorí an tléhh sleeme baraá qamuuwók kudaá sabiíbu nee awa seituúniro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Deelo lahhooe gadiyuús, ala bál faanqwe ta hungu/ús, sleerók nee daqwaywoge sleeme i hungu/usiye', nee na/aá lawaalo'oorók nee dahaaymoó do'oge i hungu/usiye'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
