              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qaytsiít aníng malaykamo u geeraahúng wa ya/aáw as kuungá' nuwa xun, nee nuwa huwi ay baraá yaamuudá' naa amohhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti harmagahhe', nee afoorós iiárií qaasaak, ma dee/anutaara' dirose, asma tlakweemaahúng gi gurtlayká, asma umuueé' in baraawós i dirii'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' bar afoorós aga ló'wa harmagahhé' iiárií qamiingo, nee tidá' sleémeero án naa kuungá' báw kari tlehhé', daqaní aníng tari wakusmoó wakuuserhúng, nee mukdá' kuungá' nu siasií' án u sií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár bar malaykamooeé' kuungá' naa geerahaár nuri hardahaás baraá yaamaaá xoorór Amori nee ar Hiti, nee ar Perisi, nee ar Kana'ani, nee ar Hifi, nee ar Yebusi, xoorduuká' ngiri hhaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungui'ín mi i tumbarara'amitara', sleeme mi sluufmisuú awaara', laqaá tlehhmi'ii'ín mi eeharara'. Ala inooín na hhaamiisaak, nee uheemii'ín sleémeero na geqaawaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' aqo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng un sluufmisá', nee aníng muruú /aymarhúng nee ma'aá wahangwhunge in tsuúq, slám aníng tiqti an hingeés baraá tla/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá ayaahuge /ameenír guruuwós kitaangw gwaa' i káhh, tam kampeeri sleeme i káhh, umuú heewo aqo diimaay gun daahh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aníng múk ayeemoodá' un geerahúng wa dae tsaát, nee mukdá' amorhúng i slaqwarár áw un tlaahhír i kwaáhh, wakuuserhúng an way'aás iri geerahúng wa /akumít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inooín in geerahúng wa diwilií tleés, as kahhó' mukduú Hifi nee oo Kana'ani nee Hitiro kiwa geerahúng wa tlatlahhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk xoordu u guusaaká gawaá qoomár kurkú wákí ale, as yaamu mindiwa deewaiyé', aluuwo makaay munduwa altlahhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inooín in tseegamiís gusisiingo dír geerahúng wa ale, ay dír kuungá' tay doogiindá' nee yaamuudá' kiwa ala'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Digmuú yaamuuhúng a iimír tlawtá Shamúr wa tleemu ay tlawtá Mediteranea, iimír xaanxáy wa tleemu ay yaaér Eufrate. Asma yaamuloouusér yaamuuká' ngi gawaá dabaahúng i qaás nee kuungá' kiri tlatlahhasá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' alqado ma tleehhara' nee inooín, laqaá tam nee munguii'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín mindiwa baraá yaamuuhúng wa hootiyé' as munduwa baraá tlakweemií dahaasiyé', aníng kuungá' iri sa dakusá'. Asma bar kuungá' munguii'ín iga sluufmisuú eeré', daqaní looeemaawo aga daté' baraá tsaaxweeli.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
